# Notification System Implementation

> **Document created**: January 9, 2026  
> **Project**: Famoria - Family Photo Sharing Application

## Overview

The Famoria notification system provides real-time, in-app and email notifications for user interactions. The system notifies users about likes, comments, tags, mentions, and family member joins.

---

## Architecture

The notification system consists of three main layers:

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[User Action] --> B[Service Layer]
    B --> C[notificationService]
    B --> D[emailService]
    C --> E[(Firestore notifications)]
    D --> F[(Firestore mail queue)]
    E --> G[Real-time Subscription]
    G --> H[NotificationBell Component]
    H --> I[User Interface]
```

---

## Data Model

### Notification Type

Located in [types.ts](file:///Users/gowthamrajsrinivasan/Downloads/famoria%202/types.ts#L126-L137)

```typescript
export interface Notification {
  id: string;                    // Auto-generated document ID
  userId: string;                // Recipient user ID
  type: 'like' | 'comment' | 'tag' | 'mention' | 'join';
  actorId: string;               // User who performed the action
  actorName: string;             // Actor's display name
  actorAvatar?: string;          // Actor's avatar URL
  message: string;               // Human-readable message
  photoId?: string;              // Related photo/post ID (optional)
  createdAt: number;             // Timestamp (milliseconds)
  isRead: boolean;               // Read status
}
```

### Notification Types

| Type | Description | Triggered By |
|------|-------------|--------------|
| `like` | User liked a photo/post | Like button click |
| `comment` | User commented on a photo | Comment submission |
| `tag` | User was tagged in a photo | Photo upload or tag update |
| `mention` | User was mentioned in a comment | @mention in comment |
| `join` | New user joined family group | Invitation acceptance |

