## UI Components

### NotificationBell Component

**Location**: [components/NotificationBell.tsx](file:///Users/gowthamrajsrinivasan/Downloads/famoria%202/components/NotificationBell.tsx)

Main notification interface component.

#### Features

1. **Real-time subscription** to user's notifications
2. **Unread count badge** (red dot indicator)
3. **Dropdown menu** with notification list
4. **Mark all read** functionality
5. **Click-outside to close** behavior
6. **Auto-mark as read** on notification click

#### Visual States

| State | UI Element |
|-------|------------|
| **No unread** | Bell icon only |
| **Has unread** | Bell icon + red badge dot |
| **Empty list** | "No notifications yet" message |
| **Open dropdown** | Scrollable list (max-height: 384px) |

#### User Interactions

```typescript
// When notification is clicked
handleItemClick = async (notification) => {
  if (!notification.isRead) {
    await notificationService.markAsRead(notification.id);
  }
  onNotificationClick(notification); // Navigate to content
  setIsOpen(false);
};

// Mark all as read
handleMarkAllRead = async () => {
  await notificationService.markAllAsRead(userId);
};
```

