## Notification Triggers

### 1. Like Notifications

**File**: [components/LikeButton.tsx](file:///Users/gowthamrajsrinivasan/Downloads/famoria%202/components/LikeButton.tsx#L41-L65)

```typescript
// When user likes a photo
await notificationService.createNotification({
  userId: photoOwnerId,
  type: 'like',
  actorId: currentUser.id,
  actorName: currentUser.name,
  actorAvatar: currentUser.avatar,
  message: `liked your memory.`,
  photoId: photoId,
  createdAt: Date.now(),
  isRead: false
});

// Send email notification
await emailService.sendNotificationEmailBackground(
  owner.email,
  owner.name,
  'like',
  { actorName: currentUser.name, message: "Liked your memory", ... }
);
```

**Trigger**: User clicks like button on a photo/post  
**Recipient**: Photo owner  
**Condition**: Only when adding a like (not removing)

---

### 2. Comment Notifications

**File**: [hooks/useInteractions.ts](file:///Users/gowthamrajsrinivasan/Downloads/famoria%202/hooks/useInteractions.ts#L84-L109)

```typescript
// When user adds a comment
await notificationService.createNotification({
  userId: photoOwnerId,
  type: 'comment',
  actorId: user.id,
  actorName: user.name,
  actorAvatar: user.avatar,
  message: `commented on your memory: "${text.substring(0, 30)}..."`,
  photoId: photoId,
  createdAt: Date.now(),
  isRead: false
});

// Send email notification
await emailService.sendNotificationEmailBackground(
  ownerProfile.email,
  ownerProfile.name,
  'comment',
  { 
    actorName: user.name, 
    message: `commented on your photo: "${text.substring(0, 50)}..."`,
    photoUrl: window.location.origin
  }
);
```

**Trigger**: User submits a comment  
**Recipient**: Photo owner  
**Message**: Includes first 30 characters of comment

---

### 3. Tag Notifications

**File**: [services/photoService.ts](file:///Users/gowthamrajsrinivasan/Downloads/famoria%202/services/photoService.ts#L224-L265)

```typescript
// When users are tagged in a photo
await photoService.notifyTaggedUsers(post, currentUser);

// Internal implementation
for (const taggedUser of usersToNotify) {
  // In-app notification
  await notificationService.createNotification({
    userId: taggedUser.userId,
    type: 'tag',
    actorId: actor.id,
    actorName: actor.name,
    actorAvatar: actor.avatar,
    message: `tagged you in a new memory.`,
    photoId: item.id,
    createdAt: Date.now(),
    isRead: false
  });

  // Email notification
  const userProfile = await userService.getUser(taggedUser.userId);
  if (userProfile?.email) {
    await emailService.sendNotificationEmailBackground(
      userProfile.email,
      userProfile.name,
      'tag',
      {
        actorName: actor.name,
        message: `tagged you in a new memory.`,
        photoUrl: window.location.href
      }
    );
  }
}
```

**Trigger**: 
- Photo upload with tagged users
- Adding tags to existing photo

**Recipients**: All tagged users  
**Feature**: Supports notifying only newly added tags (delta notifications)

---

### 4. Join Notifications

**File**: [services/invitationService.ts](file:///Users/gowthamrajsrinivasan/Downloads/famoria%202/services/invitationService.ts#L178-L231)

```typescript
// When user accepts family invitation
const newUser = await userService.getUser(userId);

// 1. Notify the inviter
await notificationService.createNotification({
  userId: invite.invitedBy,
  type: 'join',
  actorId: newUser.id,
  actorName: newUser.name,
  actorAvatar: newUser.avatar,
  message: `accepted your invitation.`,
  createdAt: Date.now(),
  isRead: false
});

// 2. Notify all family members
const members = await familyService.getFamilyMembers(invite.familyGroupId);
for (const member of members) {
  if (member.userId !== userId) {
    await notificationService.createNotification({
      userId: member.userId,
      type: 'join',
      actorId: newUser.id,
      actorName: newUser.name,
      actorAvatar: newUser.avatar,
      message: `has joined the family.`,
      createdAt: Date.now(),
      isRead: false
    });
  }
}

// 3. Email the inviter
const inviter = await userService.getUser(invite.invitedBy);
if (inviter?.email) {
  await emailService.sendNotificationEmailBackground(
    inviter.email,
    inviter.name,
    'accept_invite',
    {
      actorName: newUser.name,
      message: "Invitation accepted",
      photoUrl: window.location.origin
    }
  );
}
```

**Trigger**: User accepts family group invitation  
**Recipients**: 
1. Inviter (special notification)
2. All existing family members

