## Testing Checklist

- [ ] Like a photo → Owner receives notification
- [ ] Comment on photo → Owner receives notification
- [ ] Tag user in photo → Tagged user receives notification
- [ ] Accept invitation → Inviter and family receive notifications
- [ ] Mark notification as read → Badge count decreases
- [ ] Mark all as read → All notifications marked
- [ ] Email delivery → Check Firestore mail queue
- [ ] Real-time updates → Notification appears without refresh
- [ ] Click notification → Navigates to correct photo
- [ ] Self-notifications → User sees their own tags

